**9. The Chrome Accent**

Rather than a full chrome set, this design applies the metallic finish to just one or two nails, usually the ring finger, while the rest stay a simple matte or glossy base. It delivers the visual interest of chrome without the maintenance concern of a full mirrored set showing wear across ten nails. This is the version to request if you love the look of chrome but live in it daily, typing, washing hands, general wear. Ask your tech to apply chrome to the accent nail last, after the base set is finished, for the cleanest line between the two finishes.

